WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
Being the nicest person on the team

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.250
cost him the promotion.

3
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:04.700
His boss explained why

4
00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:05.600
in one sentence.

5
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.000
He said yes to every request,

6
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.100
even at 9 p.m. on a Friday.

7
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.450
His laptop sat open on the couch

8
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.950
while his dinner went cold.

9
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:15.400
Coworkers called him "reliable,"

10
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.600
but nobody ever asked

11
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:17.500
what he wanted.

12
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.000
His boss said,

13
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:20.200
"I can't promote someone

14
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.400
I've never heard disagree."

15
00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:22.900
In year one,

16
00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.700
he took on 6 extra projects

17
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:25.900
without asking for credit.

18
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.050
In year two,

19
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:28.850
a new hire with louder opinions

20
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.050
got his best client.

21
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.200
In year three,

22
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.400
he trained the person

23
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.900
who then became his manager.

24
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.050
In year four,

25
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:36.250
he said "no" once,

26
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.050
and his boss finally leaned in.

27
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:39.550
Agreeing with everyone

28
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.050
makes you easy to like

29
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.250
and easy to overlook.

30
00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:44.000
Try this once this week:

31
00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.200
"I see it differently.

32
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.100
Here's why."

33
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:47.600
I'm Dimples.

34
00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.700
I talk about the things we feel

35
00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.200
but never say out loud.

36
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.100
Follow for more.
